5
00:00:07,824 --> 00:00:09,264
It is like a micromanager

6
00:00:09,264 --> 00:00:10,644
who demands a full report

7
00:00:10,644 --> 00:00:11,654
every time you move a

8
00:00:11,654 --> 00:00:13,479
