9
00:00:13,479 --> 00:00:14,029
goal at hand.

10
00:00:14,556 --> 00:00:16,291
PyRUA-Lean fixes this by

11
00:00:16,291 --> 00:00:18,398
shifting to interactive code execution,

12
00:00:18,398 --> 00:00:19,781
where the agent writes Python

13
00:00:19,781 --> 00:00:21,436
cells that handle local retries

14
00:00:21,436 --> 00:00:22,721
and conditional logic.

15
00:00:23,225 --> 00:00:24,828
Instead of constant polling, the

16
00:00:24,828 --> 00:00:26,860
